    "description": "kanemaru.h5ad, the kanemaru_developmental_complete.h5ad output of the scVI/scANVI integration pipeline: a derivative of the fetal heart single-cell and single-nucleus RNA-seq of the Developing Heart Cell Atlas (Cranley, Kanemaru et al., bioRxiv 2024), not an archive download. All ten of its donors (C82, C85, C86, C87, C92, C94, C97, C98, C99 and Hst33; 7 to 15 post-conception weeks) are donors of that atlas, and none is a donor of the adult-heart study E-MTAB-12916. The study has deposited no RNA accession in a public archive, so it is identified by its preprint DOI and its data portal.",
    "redistribution": "Not redistributable. The file is never copied into this repository; the builder reads it from --source-dir and refuses any other bytes.",
    "upstream_accession": null,
    "upstream_doi": "10.1101/2024.04.29.591736",
